But process increments c.round each time, so setting c.round=r then lastProcessed=r-1 is okay. Actually after first call round=1; setting round=1 again for r=1 means it processes but guard lastProcessed===round? we set lastProcessed=0, round=1 → not equal, processes, round=2. Good.

Then finalize. `points` accumulate: player gets 30, AI 24 etc. champ true. `completed` true. Good.

